@startuml WebApp Module Structure

title WebApp Module - React + TypeScript SPA

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam package {
    BackgroundColor #F8F8F8
    BorderColor #999999
}

package "webApp" {
    
    [index.html\nRoot] as HTML #646CFF
    
    package "src" #61DAFB {
        [index.tsx\nEntry Point] as Index
        
        package "components" {
            package "Greeting" {
                [Greeting.tsx] as GreetingTSX
                [Greeting.css] as GreetingCSS
                
                note right of GreetingTSX
                    React 컴포넌트
                    
                    shared 모듈의
                    Greeting 클래스 사용
                end note
                
                GreetingTSX --> GreetingCSS : styles
            }
            
            package "JSLogo" {
                [JSLogo.tsx] as LogoTSX
                [JSLogo.css] as LogoCSS
                
                note right of LogoTSX
                    로고 컴포넌트
                end note
                
                LogoTSX --> LogoCSS : styles
            }
        }
        
        Index --> GreetingTSX : renders
        Index --> LogoTSX : renders
    }
    
    [vite.config.ts\nBuild Config] as Vite #646CFF
    [tsconfig.json\nTS Config] as TSConfig #3178C6
    [package.json\nDependencies] as Package
    
    HTML --> Index : loads
}

package "Shared JS Module" #7F52FF {
    [shared.js\n(Kotlin/JS)] as SharedJS
    [shared.d.ts\n(TypeScript)] as SharedTS
    
    note right of SharedJS
        Kotlin/JS로 컴파일된
        JavaScript 모듈
    end note
    
    note right of SharedTS
        TypeScript 타입 정의
        generateTypeScriptDefinitions()
    end note
}

GreetingTSX --> SharedJS : imports
GreetingTSX --> SharedTS : type checking

package "Dependencies" {
    [React 18] as React
    [React DOM] as ReactDOM
    [Vite] as ViteDep
    [TypeScript] as TS
}

Index --> React
Index --> ReactDOM
Vite --> ViteDep
TSConfig --> TS

note bottom of webApp
    **빌드 설정**
    - Vite (빌드 도구)
    - React 18
    - TypeScript
    
    **개발 서버**
    - Hot Module Replacement
    - Fast Refresh
    
    **Shared 모듈 통합**
    - Kotlin/JS 컴파일 결과 사용
    - TypeScript 타입 정의 자동 생성
    - @JsExport로 노출된 API 사용
end note

@enduml
